  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The test LdpTestSuiteIT is producing large numbers of stacktraces/failures, but the failures to not cause the test to fail according to maven and junit.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The errors have been happening for quite a while, but the numbers have increased over time. Here is a successful PR build from April 2018:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://api.travis-ci.org/v3/job/367880983/log.txt"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://api.travis-ci.org/v3/job/367880983/log.txt",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Which shows 20 failures for IndirectContainerTest, 24 for DirectContainerTest",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "While in March 2017:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://api.travis-ci.org/v3/job/211829546/log.txt"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://api.travis-ci.org/v3/job/211829546/log.txt",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "There were 3 failures for IndirectContainerTest, and 3 for DirectContainerTest",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Investigate to determine if these failures are a problem, why the number is increasing. Also can determine if it would be appropriate for the test to fail the maven build or not.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
