      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>PR with minor improvement: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1441\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1441</a></p>\n\n<p>Currently, there are 87 test failures in total.</p>\n\n<p>Failures due to LDP:* namespace change: 38</p>\n\n<p>Failures due to an ldp-testsuite bug (resolved in master) that does not recognize \"text/turtle;charset=utf-8\" as text/turtle content-type: 49</p>\n\n<p>Resolving these two issues will not make all the failing tests to pass, I think in some cases it will reveal other failures that are currently masked by these failures.</p>",
