  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": "<p>The test LdpTestSuiteIT is producing large numbers of stacktraces/failures, but the failures to not cause the test to fail according to maven and junit.</p>\n\n<p>The errors have been happening for quite a while, but the numbers have increased over time. Here is a successful PR build from April 2018:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://api.travis-ci.org/v3/job/367880983/log.txt\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://api.travis-ci.org/v3/job/367880983/log.txt</a></p>\n\n<p>Which shows 20 failures for IndirectContainerTest, 24 for DirectContainerTest</p>\n\n<p>While in March 2017:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://api.travis-ci.org/v3/job/211829546/log.txt\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://api.travis-ci.org/v3/job/211829546/log.txt</a></p>\n\n<p>There were 3 failures for IndirectContainerTest, and 3 for DirectContainerTest</p>\n\n<p>Investigate to determine if these failures are a problem, why the number is increasing. Also can determine if it would be appropriate for the test to fail the maven build or not.</p>",
